2,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名角色或泛論保存，文武合稱不補個人錨點；韓盧犬喻不當人物，王者泛論不套秦昭王。"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m013-0770","start":770,"end":772,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"zus_do8_z1q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m013-0786","start":786,"end":788,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"pvp_ebv_zcb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m013-0792","start":792,"end":793,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"zus_do8_z1q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m013-0795","start":795,"end":797,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"zus_do8_z1q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m013-0810","start":810,"end":812,"surface":"范睢","kind":"person","person_id":"zus_do8_z1q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m013-0814","start":814,"end":816,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai","book_id":"b-shiji-079","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-079-fancai"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:p020","text":"後數日，蒯通復說曰：『夫聽者事之候也，計者事之機也，聽過計失而能久安者，鮮矣。聽不失一二者，不可亂以言；計不失本末者，不可紛以辭。夫隨廝養之役者，失萬乘之權；守儋石之祿者，闕卿相之位。故知者決之斷也，疑者事之害也，審豪氂之小計，遺天下之大數，智誠知之，決弗敢行者，百事之禍也。故曰「猛虎之猶豫，不若蜂蠆之致螫；騏驥之跼躅，不如駑馬之安步；孟賁之狐疑，不如庸夫之必至也；雖有舜禹之智，吟而不言，不如瘖聾之指麾也」。此言貴能行之。夫功者難成而易敗，時者難得而易失也。時乎時，不再來。願足下詳察之。』韓信猶豫不忍倍漢，又自以爲功多，漢終不奪我齊，遂謝蒯通。蒯通說不聽，已詳狂爲巫。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m020-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"蒯通","kind":"person","person_id":"x9q_ghs_z2s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m020-0169","start":169,"end":171,"surface":"孟賁","kind":"person","person_id":"dwv_5hn_680","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m020-0186","start":186,"end":187,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m020-0187","start":187,"end":188,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"6ip_dr3_fbl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m020-0247","start":247,"end":249,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m020-0272","start":272,"end":274,"surface":"蒯通","kind":"person","person_id":"x9q_ghs_z2s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m020-0275","start":275,"end":277,"surface":"蒯通","kind":"person","person_id":"x9q_ghs_z2s","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin","book_id":"b-shiji-092","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-092-hanxin"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p005","text":"淮南王至雍，病死，聞，上輟食，哭甚哀。盎入，頓首請罪。上曰：「以不用公言至此。」盎曰：「上自寬，此往事，豈可悔哉！且陛下有高世之行者三，此不足以毀名。」上曰：「吾高世行三者何事？」盎曰：「陛下居代時，太后嘗病，三年，陛下不交睫，不解衣，湯藥非陛下口所嘗弗進。夫曾參以布衣猶難之，今陛下親以王者修之，過曾參孝遠矣。夫諸呂用事，大臣專制，然陛下從代乘六傳馳不測之淵，雖賁育之勇不及陛下。陛下至代邸，西向讓天子位者再，南面讓天子位者三。夫許由一讓，而陛下五以天下讓，過許由四矣。且陛下遷淮南王，欲以苦其志，使改過，有司衛不謹，故病死。」於是上乃解，曰：「將柰何？」盎曰：「淮南王有三子，唯在陛下耳。」於是文帝立其三子皆為王。盎由此名重朝廷。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"淮南王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"盎","kind":"person","person_id":"j32_wtj_khz_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"盎","kind":"person","person_id":"j32_wtj_khz_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0076","start":76,"end":77,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0090","start":90,"end":91,"surface":"盎","kind":"person","person_id":"j32_wtj_khz_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"9zj_vf7_86a_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0130","start":130,"end":132,"surface":"曾參","kind":"person","person_id":"sci_1hw_slc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0150","start":150,"end":152,"surface":"曾參","kind":"person","person_id":"sci_1hw_slc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"諸呂","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、學說合稱、典故或待辨匿名指代，未補成員及姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0182","start":182,"end":183,"surface":"賁","kind":"person","person_id":"dwv_5hn_680","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"原合稱賁育依孟康注拆為兩人；舊起點ID保留於賁，育另有逐人錨點，原文不改。"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0183","start":183,"end":184,"surface":"育","kind":"person","person_id":"66l_m67_5ie","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"孟康注賁育為孟賁、夏育；此字連夏育，不與孟賁合為一人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0216","start":216,"end":218,"surface":"許由","kind":"person","person_id":"h68_fxp_gwo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0231","start":231,"end":233,"surface":"許由","kind":"person","person_id":"h68_fxp_gwo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0240","start":240,"end":243,"surface":"淮南王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m005-0267","start":267,"end":268,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_n